pi.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33464949925/logs\",\"check_suite_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/check-suites/90679726882\",\"artifacts_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33464949925/artifacts\",\"cancel_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33464949925/cancel\",\"rerun_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33464949925/rerun\",\"previous_attempt_url\":null,\"workflow_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/workflows/223593140\",\"head_commit\":{\"id\":\"e7470d685ec654e307078999dd4c7ae3d3252c3e\",\"tree_id\":\"868a02579855e8fdfa0ee8dc0f94e097bab94421\",\"message\":\"fix(chain): resolve a step's previous against the step above it, in one place\\n\\nThe confirm modal, the command preview, and the bash export each carried their\\nown copy of the interpolation loop, and all three set previous after resolving\\na step rather than before, so a chain's preview named the step two above and\\ndisagreed with what ChainExecutor dispatched. chain.ResolveSteps is now the one\\nimplementation all three call.\\n\\nA modal can no longer render past the terminal, and the chain confirmation\\nwraps a long dispatch command instead of widening past the edge, because the\\nwhole command is what a reader checks before confirming. Enter on a chain\\nvariable accepts the value on screen; space and the arrows change it.\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-01T03:05:34Z\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Kyle King\",\"email\":\"KyleKing@users.noreply.github.com\"},\"committer\":{\"name\":\"Kyle King\",\"email\":\"KyleKing@users.noreply.github.com\"}},\"repository\":{\"id\":1133962745,\"node_id\":\"R_kgDOQ5bl-Q\",\"name\":\"gh-lazydispatch\",\"full_name\":\"KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch\",\"private\":false,\"owner\":{\"login\":\"KyleKing\",\"id\":3784339,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODQzMzk=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars